From: YunPin contributors <noreply@yunpin.invalid>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 23:32:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] yunpin: remove WinSparkle link from preview service

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
Upstream-Base: rime/weasel@9cc96e20dc71b80876b12f689bb5863c76c2a7ed

The development preview has no trusted YunPin update channel. Remove the
remaining header whose pragma would add the WinSparkle import library even
though all update calls were disabled by the identity patch.

diff --git a/WeaselServer/WeaselServer.cpp b/WeaselServer/WeaselServer.cpp
--- a/WeaselServer/WeaselServer.cpp
+++ b/WeaselServer/WeaselServer.cpp
@@ -8,7 +8,6 @@
 #include <WeaselUI.h>
 #include <RimeWithWeasel.h>
 #include <WeaselUtility.h>
-#include <winsparkle.h>
 #include <functional>
 #include <ShellScalingApi.h>
 #include <WinUser.h>
